  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 15th level, the ungermaw can attempt to devour the magical energies within an area or item. By spending 3 uses of draw breath, the ungermaw can cast mage’s disjunction as a spell-like ability, using his ungermaw level as his caster level. Only effects within the range of the ungermaw’s draw breath ability are subject to being dispelled.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ungermaw#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
